{"path":"memory/gc/get_pointer_safety","title":"std::get_pointer_safety","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>get_pointer_safety","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/gc/get_pointer_safety","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Obtains the implementation-defined pointer safety model, which is a value of type std::pointer_safety.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/memory\">&lt;memory&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/gc/pointer_safety\"><span class=\"kw755\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pointer_safety</span></span></a> get_pointer_safety<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx23\">(removed in C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Obtains the implementation-defined pointer safety model, which is a value of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/gc/pointer_safety\">std::pointer_safety</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The pointer safety used by this implementation.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;memory&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Pointer safety: \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">switch</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get_pointer_safety</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/gc/pointer_safety\"><span class=\"kw758\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pointer_safety</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">strict</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"strict<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">break</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/gc/pointer_safety\"><span class=\"kw757\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pointer_safety</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">preferred</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"preferred<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">break</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/gc/pointer_safety\"><span class=\"kw756\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pointer_safety</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">relaxed</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"relaxed<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">break</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Pointer safety: relaxed</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/gc/pointer_safety\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>pointer_safety</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx23\">(removed in C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  lists pointer safety models <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(enum)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::get_pointer_safety","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11, until C++23. Obtains the implementation-defined pointer safety model, which is a value of type std::pointer_safety."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The pointer safety used by this implementation."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"pointer_safety","note":"lists pointer safety models"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++23"],"wordCount":87,"codeBlockCount":2}
